  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/#the-iframe-element:html-element-insertion-steps says: \"[Create a new child navigable](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/#create-a-new-child-navigable) for insertedNode.\" That algorithm contains \"Let browsingContext and document be the result of [creating a new browsing context and document](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/#creating-a-new-browsing-context)\".\r\n\r\nMeanwhile, https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-insert-ext explicitly calls out that insertion steps must not create new browsing contexts.",
